# File   :  DJ9.PAR
# Content:  Controls and parameters for DE
# Author :  Mikal Keenan <keenan@cis.uab.edu>
#                   <http://www.cis.uab.edu/info/grads/mbk
# Update :  09/11/96
# Note that comments begin with "# ", the space is necessary for now
# because the control object processes a file one token at a time, i.e.,
# whatever "ifstream >> x" returns (depends on the storage type of x).
# The control object will ignore blank lines and lines prepended with "# "
# It will also ignore the rest of a data line beyond "# " (see below).
# Place DE controls in any order in these files and specify any
# combination of the available halting criteria...
#
#   Criterion   :  Meaning
#   ~~~~~~~~~~~~:~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
#   Generations :  Number of generations to run before halting
#   Time        :  Number of seconds to run before halting
#   Minimum     :  Target value to reach before halting
#   Stasis      :  Number of generations without change before halting
#
# Mikal Keenan <keenan@cis.uab.edu>
# <http://www.cis.uab.edu/info/grads/mbk>

Minimum       0.0        # Stop upon reaching a minimum of 0.0, or
Time          300        # Stop after 5 minutes of processing, or
Stasis        100        # Stop after 100 generations of redundancy, or
Generations   3000       # Stop after 3000 generations
Refresh       100        # Display status every 100 generations
Members       60         # Population size
Variables     9          # Number of values to optimize
VarMinimum   -100.0      # Minimum value for variable randomization
VarMaximum    100.0      # Maximum value for variable randomization
FConstant     0.9        # Gotta read the tech report for this one...
Crossover     1.0        # Crossover rate
Seed          9          # If 0, RNG will use current time as seed
Strategy      ExpBest1   # Which evolution strategy to use

